meta {
  name: GET Protocol Events
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: {{baseURL}}/supplementation/protocols/{{protocol_id}}/events/?page=1&limit=10
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 10
  ~action:
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}

docs {
  Staff audit for one protocol. Admin + associate. No X-Center-ID.
  Unknown id → 404. Inactive protocol still loads.
  Subset of GET Profile Events: same row, same order, same page/limit/action.
  Other protocols and null protocol_id rows are omitted.
  page, limit (default 10, max 50). Newest created_at first.
  action: optional stored action code. Junk → 400 "Invalid action."
  Includes client_visible false.
  data[]: id, action, reason, client_visible, client_title, change_type, effective_on,
  protocol_id, protocol_version_id, before, after, created_at.
  Stored supplement_id in before/after is returned as
  supplement {id, product_name, brand_name, form}.
  form is the stored code. Stored JSON keeps supplement_id.
  Env: protocol_id from GET Profile Protocols id.
}
